Z||000015||88 Fiero||10-01-1999||06:24 PM||||Over the Roof Scoops can be used in either doing a ram air effect for your intake, you can pull air on the top and customize a plumbing for your car to breath. I see other people in the past used it an air-to-air intercooler and others to pull cold air and cool down the engine compartment and others just a display. The IMSA Fiero on the other hand uses this Scoop to pull cold air to it's throttle body for maximum air intake...||||reg||1
Z||000016||88 Fiero||10-01-1999||06:26 PM||||I love it when I use to have this scoops on my old Fiero.. I mean guys that drives IROC Z's in my neighborhood will never try and race me because they think I got something under my deck lid like a Supercharger. The truth is my car was running without a Cat and makes a loud sweet mean noise that makes them wonder...||||reg||1
